Package: nmtools
Title: R Tools for Direct NONMEM Workflow Automation
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Nicolas", "Simon", email = "nicolas.simon@univ-amu.fr",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4393-2257"))
Description: Direct execution of NONMEM via nmfe (no Wings, no PsN),
    parsing of NONMEM output files (.lst, .ext, .phi, .fit),
    VPC/pc-VPC generation, dataset preparation and visualization,
    and run comparison tools for pharmacometric workflows.
